HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The jjaaiill() system call appeared in FreeBSD 4.0.  The jjaaiill__aattttaacchh() system
     call appeared in FreeBSD 5.1.  The jjaaiill__sseett(), jjaaiill__ggeett(), and
     jjaaiill__rreemmoovvee() system calls appeared in FreeBSD 8.0.

